  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Waterproof</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A long-wear, transfer-proof lip liner that sculpts, defines and fills in your lips in one simplified step.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type:</strong> Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-Wearing</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Provides antioxidant protection.</p><p>- Coconut Oil: Hydrates and nourishes lips.</p><p>- Candelilla Wax: Imparts a rich, smooth texture and softens lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar,</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use to outline lips. <br>-Wait up to 60 seconds for the formula to set.<br>-Wear alone or follow with REFY Lip Gloss or Lip Blush (each sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Isododecane, Ozokerite, Phenyl Trimethicone, Polyethylene, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Silica, Aluminum Hydroxide, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Propylene Carbonate, Mica, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phenoxyethanol, Distearimonium Hectorite, Aminopropyl Triethoxysilane &nbsp;[+/- May Contain: Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Yellow 6 Lake (Ci 15985), Red 40 Lake (Ci 16035), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891)].</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Waterproof</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A long-wear, transfer-proof lip liner that sculpts, defines and fills in your lips in one simplified step.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type:</strong> Lip Liner</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Long-Wearing</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Provides antioxidant protection.</p><p>- Coconut Oil: Hydrates and nourishes lips.</p><p>- Candelilla Wax: Imparts a rich, smooth texture and softens lips.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar,</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use to outline lips. <br>-Wait up to 60 seconds for the formula to set.<br>-Wear alone or follow with REFY Lip Gloss or Lip Blush (each sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Isododecane, Ozokerite, Phenyl Trimethicone, Polyethylene, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Silica, Aluminum Hydroxide, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Propylene Carbonate, Mica, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Tocopheryl Acetate, Phenoxyethanol, Distearimonium Hectorite, Aminopropyl Triethoxysilane &nbsp;[+/- May Contain: Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Yellow 6 Lake (Ci 15985), Red 40 Lake (Ci 16035), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891)].</p></div></details>",
